\tab 欢迎使用 \b Mission Planner\b0，这是一款用于无人飞行器（\b UAV\b0）的任务规划软件。\par
\pard\nowidctlpar\fi720\b 帮助：\par
ArduPlane: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://ardupilot.org/plane"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 http://ardupilot.org/plane}}}\f0\fs22\par
ArduCopter: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://ardupilot.org/copter"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 http://ardupilot.org/copter}}}\f0\fs22\par
ArduRover: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://ardupilot.org/rover"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 http://ardupilot.org/rover}}}\f0\fs22\par
\par
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\tab 请访问 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://ardupilot.org/planner"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 http://ardupilot.org/planner}}}\f0\fs22 获取更多信息。\b0\par
\pard\nowidctlpar\b\tab 主要开发者：\b0 Michael Oborne\par
\tab\b 设计：\b0 Samantha Nelson\par
\tab\b 贡献者：\b0 Andrew Radford, Marooned, Ryan Beall, Tom Pittenger 以及 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/graphs/contributors"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/graphs/contributors}}}\f0\fs22\par
\pard\nowidctlpar\fi720\b ArduCopter 插图：\b0 Max Levine\par
\b 库：\b0 Gmap.net, Sharpkml, SharpZipLib, IronPython, KMLib, OpenTK, ZedGraph, alglib, BouncyCastle, DotSpatial, LibVLC, netDXF\par
\par
\b 对 Mission Planner 开发做出贡献的公司：\b0 3D Robotics, Falcon Unmanned, UAV Solutions\b\par
\par
快捷键\par
\par
主界面\par
F2 - 飞行数据\par
F3 - 飞行规划\par
F4 - 参数调校\par
F5 - 刷新完整参数列表\par
Control-F - 温度屏幕\par
Control-T - 盲连\par
\par
飞行数据\par
1 - 标签页 1\par
2 - 标签页 2\par
3 - 标签页 3\par
4 - 标签页 4\par
5 - 标签页 5\par
6 - 标签页 6\par
7 - 标签页 7\par
8 - 标签页 8\par
9 - 标签页 9\par
0 - 标签页 10\par
\par
飞行规划\par
Control-Z - 撤销\par
Control-O - 打开航点文件\par
Control-S - 保存航点文件\par
\par
自动航点网格\par
Control-O - 打开网格文件\par
Control-S - 保存网格文件\par
\par
